{"meta":{"id":"dm.aHR0cDovL3NlcnZlcjEuZGhha2Ftb3ZpZS5jb20vTW92aWVzL0hvbGx5d29vZC8yMDAwLS0yMDEwL0Rlc2VydCUyMFNhaW50cyUyMCUyODIwMDIlMjkv","type":"movie","name":"Desert Saints","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342/2as5ytuOjrT01xr4wmqJBhfUNlV.jpg","background":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/1R5fVcVM0DwlFcjMDWj8PqRAnKv.jpg","description":"Banks is a hit man, the best, usually working for Latin American drug cartels. He picks up solitary women, uses them briefly for a job, then kills them. He's in the Southwest, headed toward Mexico, when he picks up Bennie, a woman leaving an abusive marriage, going to Paradise, Arizona. The film follows three tracks: Banks's slow recruitment of Bennie, the set-up for the hit at a swank resort in Mexico, and the FBI's close pursuit of Banks, whom they want alive in hopes he'll rat out his bosses. Bennie may not be who she seems, and there may be a chink in Banks's tough-guy armor. Guns, money, and a chance at Paradise.\n\nRated R · Released 10 Mar 2002 · United States of America · Language: English · 88 min\nStudio: Sagg Main Productions, City Heat Productions, Prufrock Pictures\n\nOn your server — Audio: English · Subtitle files: English","releaseInfo":"2002","genres":["Action","Romance","Thriller","Hollywood"],"imdbRating":"5.8","runtime":"88 min","cast":["Kiefer Sutherland","Melora Walters","Jamey Sheridan","Leslie Stefanson","Bill Sage","Keith Diamond","Shawn Woods","Christopher Bersh"],"director":["Richard Greenberg"],"released":"2002-03-10T00:00:00.000Z","app_extras":{"cast":[{"name":"Richard Greenberg","character":"Director","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/eJsL5QkAFgJ9gOsgd5LGYylgerg.jpg"},{"name":"Kiefer Sutherland","character":"Arthur Banks","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/tK5zjdvao2NELns3bqT7PPqPeJI.jpg"},{"name":"Melora Walters","character":"Bennie Harper","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/FSxiDBekrKgmzow1j3UhmNHOhI.jpg"},{"name":"Jamey Sheridan","character":"Agent George Scanlon","photo":"https